<title>USA: U.S. aluminum stocks higher in Dec- ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. aluminum stocks higher in Dec- ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. aluminum stocks held by integrated and non-integrated producers and smelters including scrap, ingot, metal in-process and finished products rose to 2,021,000 short tons in December from 2,015,000 short tons in November, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Primary Production rose to 336,000 short tons in December from 325,000 short tons in November.</p>
<p>Net shipments were 744,000 short tons in December versus 757,000 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
